{"speciesId":106,"names":{"fr":"Kicklee","es":"Hitmonlee","en":"Hitmonlee","ja":"サワムラー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"When in a hurry, its legs lengthen progressively. It runs smoothly with extra long, loping strides."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"When in a hurry, its legs lengthen progressively. It runs smoothly with extra long, loping strides."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"When kicking, the sole of its foot turns as hard as a diamond on im­ pact and destroys its enemy."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"This amazing POKé­ MON has an awesome sense of balance. It can kick in succession from any position."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"If it starts kick­ ing repeatedly, both legs will stretch even long­ er to strike a fleeing foe."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It is also called the Kick Master. It uses its elastic legs to execute every known kick."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"HITMONLEE’s legs freely contract and stretch. Using these springlike legs, it bowls over foes with devastating kicks. After battle, it rubs down its legs and loosens the muscles to overcome fatigue."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"HITMONLEE’s legs freely contract and stretch. Using these springlike legs, it bowls over foes with devastating kicks. After battle, it rubs down its legs and loosens the muscles to overcome fatigue."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Its legs freely stretch and contract. Using these springlike limbs, it bowls over foes with devastating kicks. After battle, it rubs down its tired legs."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"The legs freely contract and stretch. The stretchy legs allow it to hit a distant foe with a rising kick."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"When in a hurry, its legs lengthen progressively. It runs smoothly with extra-long, loping strides."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its legs can stretch double. First-time foes are startled by its extensible reach."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its legs can stretch double. First-time foes are startled by its extensible reach."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its legs can stretch double. First-time foes are startled by its extensible reach."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"This amazing Pokémon has an awesome sense of balance. It can kick in succession from any position."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"If it starts kicking repeatedly, both legs will stretch even longer to strike a fleeing foe."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ses pattes élastiques s’allongent, ce qui ne manque jamais de surprendre au premier combat."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its legs can stretch double. First-time foes are startled by its extensible reach."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ses pattes élastiques s’allongent, ce qui ne manque jamais de surprendre au premier combat."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its legs can stretch double. First-time foes are startled by its extensible reach."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its legs can stretch double. First-time foes are startled by its extensible reach."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its legs can stretch double. First-time foes are startled by its extensible reach."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Kicklee peut rétracter et allonger ses jambes à sa guise. La formidable allonge dont il dispose lui donne souvent l’avantage en plein combat."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Encoge y estira las patas a su antojo. Cuando las estira, es capaz de propinar una buena patada al enemigo."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The legs freely contract and stretch. The stretchy legs allow it to hit a distant foe with a rising kick."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"脚が 自由に 伸び縮みして 遠く 離れている 場合でも 相手を 蹴り上げることができる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"S’il commence à donner des séries de coups de pied, ses jambes grandissent et il gagne en allonge."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Si empieza a dar patadas, sus patas se alargarán aún más para golpear al enemigo en su huida."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"If it starts kicking repeatedly, both legs will stretch even longer to strike a fleeing foe."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"連続で キックを 放つうちに 両足は どんどん 伸びて 逃げ出そうとする 相手も 蹴れる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Les jambes de Kicklee peuvent se contracter et s’étirer à volonté. Grâce à ces jambes à ressort, il terrasse ses ennemis en les rouant de coups de pied. Après les combats, il masse ses jambes pour éviter de sentir la fatigue."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Hitmonlee tiene la facilidad de encoger y estirar las patas. Con extremidades tan flexibles, propina unas patadas demoledoras. Tras la lucha, se masajea las piernas y relaja los músculos para descansar."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Hitmonlee’s legs freely contract and stretch. Using these springlike legs, it bowls over foes with devastating kicks. After battle, it rubs down its legs and loosens the muscles to overcome fatigue."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"自在に 伸び縮みする 足で 強烈な キックを 放ち 相手を 蹴り倒す。 戦いの 後 疲れた 足を もみ解す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Les jambes de Kicklee peuvent se contracter et s’étirer à volonté. Grâce à ces jambes à ressort, il terrasse ses ennemis en les rouant de coups de pied. Après les combats, il masse ses jambes pour éviter de sentir la fatigue."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Hitmonlee tiene la facilidad de encoger y estirar las patas. Con extremidades tan flexibles, propina unas patadas demoledoras. Tras la lucha, se masajea las piernas y relaja los músculos para descansar."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Hitmonlee’s legs freely contract and stretch. Using these springlike legs, it bowls over foes with devastating kicks. After battle, it rubs down its legs and loosens the muscles to overcome fatigue."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"自在に 伸び縮みする 足で 強烈な キックを 放ち 相手を 蹴り倒す。 戦いの 後 疲れた 足を もみ解す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Ses pieds deviennent durs comme le diamant quand il donne des coups, pulvérisant ainsi ses adversaires."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"La planta de los pies se le vuelve tan dura como el diamante al dar patadas a su oponente, hasta el punto de aniquilarlo."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"When kicking, the sole of its foot turns as hard as a diamond on impact and destroys its enemy."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"キックがあたる 瞬間！ 足のウラが ダイヤモンドのように 硬くなって 相手を 破壊する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Ses pieds deviennent durs comme le diamant quand il donne des coups, pulvérisant ainsi ses adversaires."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"La planta de los pies se le vuelve tan dura como el diamante al dar patadas a su oponente, hasta el punto de aniquilarlo."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"When kicking, the sole of its foot turns as hard as a diamond on impact and destroys its enemy."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"キックがあたる 瞬間！ 足のウラが ダイヤモンドのように 硬くなって 相手を 破壊する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il possède un fantastique sens de l’équilibre, et peut donner des rafales de coups de pied dans toutes les positions."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Este Pokémon tiene un sentido del equilibrio increíble. Puede dar patadas desde cualquier posición."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This amazing Pokémon has an awesome sense of balance. It can kick in succession from any position."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"見事な バランス感覚。 どんな 姿勢でも 連続で キックを 放てる すごい やつ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"s